1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:06,398
Self-reported skill levels are generous, so a "4 out of 5" says little.

2
00:00:06,848 --> 00:00:14,601
Meet QuantSkill. An adaptive, gamified skills assessment for R, Git, Shiny, internal tools.

3
00:00:15,051 --> 00:00:23,213
QuantSkill measures what people can actually do, with adaptive questions, confidence stakes and a report for every skill area.

4
00:00:23,663 --> 00:00:28,659
Prove. Adaptive questions, each locked in with a confidence stake.

5
00:00:29,109 --> 00:00:34,739
Draw a balanced set of open questions, print the script, then grade answers live.

6
00:00:35,189 --> 00:00:42,228
Combine everyone's results to find real strengths, hidden gaps and where self-perception drifts from evidence.

7
00:00:45,478 --> 00:00:48,495
QuantSkill. Skills, measured.
